on Oz</span><span class=\\\"go\\\">Read now &rarr;</span></a></li>\\n<li class=\\\"card\\\"><a class=\\\"book\\\" href=\\\"https://themarvelouslandofoz.com/07.htm\\\"><span class=\\\"num\\\">Book 7</span><span class=\\\"title\\\">The Patchwork Girl of Oz</span><span class=\\\"year\\\">1913 &middot; Ojo, Scraps and the Crooked Magician</span><span class=\\\"go\\\">Read now &rarr;</span></a></li>\\n<li class=\\\"card\\\"><a class=\\\"book\\\" href=\\\"https://themarvelouslandofoz.com/09.htm\\\"><span class=\\\"num\\\">Book 8</span><span class=\\\"title\\\">Tik-Tok of Oz</span><span class=\\\"year\\\">1914 &middot; Betsy Bobbin and the Rose Kingdom</span><span class=\\\"go\\\">Read now &rarr;</span></a></li>\\n<li class=\\\"card\\\"><a class=\\\"book\\\" href=\\\"https://themarvelouslandofoz.com/10.htm\\\"><span class=\\\"num\\\">Book 9</span><span class=\\\"title\\\">The Scarecrow of Oz</span><span class=\\\"year\\\">1915 &middot; Trot, Cap&rsquo;n Bill and Jinjur&rsquo;s land</span><span class=\\\"go\\\">Read now &rarr;</span></a></li>\\n<li class=\\\"card\\\"><a class=\\\"book\\\" href=\\\"https://themarvelouslandofoz.com/11.htm\\\"><span class=\\\"num\\\">Book 10</span><span class=\\\"title\\\">Rinkitink in Oz</span><span class=\\\"year\\\">1916 &middot; Prince Inga, Bilbil and three magic pearls</span><span class=\\\"go\\\">Read now &rarr;</span></a></li>\\n<li class=\\\"card\\\"><a class=\\\"book\\\" href=\\\"https://themarvelouslandofoz.com/12.htm\\\"><span class=\\\"num\\\">Book 11</span><span class=\\\"title\\\">The Lost Princess of Oz</span><span class=\\\"year\\\">1917 &middot; Ozma vanishes &mdash; and so does the Great Book</span><span class=\\\"go\\\">Read now &rarr;</span></a></li>\\n<li class=\\\"card\\\"><a class=\\\"book\\\" href=\\\"https://themarvelouslandofoz.com/13.htm\\\"><span class=\\\"num\\\">Book 12</span><span class=\\\"title\\\">The Tin Woodman of Oz</span><span class=\\\"year\\\">1918 &middot; Nick Chopper searches for his lost love</span>