arecrow of Oz free\\\"></a>\\n      </li>\\n      <li class=\\\"card\\\">\\n        <span class=\\\"num\\\">Book 10</span>\\n        <h3><a href=\\\"https://themarvelouslandofoz.com/11.htm\\\">Rinkitink in Oz</a></h3>\\n        <span class=\\\"year\\\">1916</span>\\n        <span class=\\\"read\\\">Read free</span>\\n        <a class=\\\"stretch\\\" href=\\\"https://themarvelouslandofoz.com/11.htm\\\" aria-label=\\\"Read Rinkitink in Oz free\\\"></a>\\n      </li>\\n      <li class=\\\"card\\\">\\n        <span class=\\\"num\\\">Book 11</span>\\n        <h3><a href=\\\"https://themarvelouslandofoz.com/12.htm\\\">The Lost Princess of Oz</a></h3>\\n        <span class=\\\"year\\\">1917</span>\\n        <span class=\\\"read\\\">Read free</span>\\n        <a class=\\\"stretch\\\" href=\\\"https://themarvelouslandofoz.com/12.htm\\\" aria-label=\\\"Read The Lost Princess of Oz free\\\"></a>\\n      </li>\\n      <li class=\\\"card\\\">\\n        <span class=\\\"num\\\">Book 12</span>\\n        <h3><a href=\\\"https://themarvelouslandofoz.com/13.htm\\\">The Tin Woodman of Oz</a></h3>\\n        <span class=\\\"year\\\">1918</span>\\n        <span class=\\\"read\\\">Read free</span>\\n        <a class=\\\"stretch\\\" href=\\\"https://themarvelouslandofoz.com/13.htm\\\" aria-label=\\\"Read The Tin Woodman of Oz free\\\"></a>\\n      </li>\\n      <li class=\\\"card\\\">\\n        <span class=\\\"num\\\">Book 13</span>\\n        <h3><a href=\\\"https://themarvelouslandofoz.com/14.htm\\\">The Magic of Oz</a></h3>\\n        <span class=\\\"year\\\">1919</span>\\n        <span class=\\\"read\\\">Read free</span>\\n        <a class=\\\"stretch\\\" href=\\\"https://themarvelouslandofoz.com/14.htm\\\" aria-label=\\\"Read The Magic of Oz free\\\"></a>\\n      </li>\\n      <li class=\\\"card\\\">\\n        <span class=\\\"num\\\">Book 14</span>\\n        <h3><a href=\\\"https://themarvelouslandofoz.com/15.htm\\\">Glinda of Oz</a></h3>\\n        <span class=\\\"year\\\">1920 &middot; the final Baum Oz novel</span>\\n        <span class=\\\"read\\\">Read free</span>\\n        <a class=\\\"stretch\\\" href=\\\"https://themarvelouslandofoz.com/15.htm\\\" aria-label=\\\"Read Glinda of Oz free\\\"></a>\\n      </li>\\n      <li class=\\\"card\\\">\\n        <span class=\\\"num bonus\\\">Bonus &middot; short stories</span>\\n        <h3><a href=\\\"https://themarvelouslandofoz.com/08.htm\\\">Little Wizard Stories of Oz</a></h3>\\n        <span class=\\\"year\\\">1913 &middot; six short tales</span>\\n        <span class=\\\"read\\\">Read free</span>\\n        <a class=\\\"stretch\\\" href=\\\"https://themarvelouslandofoz.com/08.htm\\\" aria-label=\\\"Read Little Wizard Stories of Oz free\\\"></a>\\n      </li>\\n      <li class=\\\"card\\\">\\n        <span class=\\\"num bonus\\\">Bonus &middot; PDF stage play</span>\\n        <h3><a href=\\\"https://themarvelouslandofoz.com/OzPlay.pdf\\\">The Wizard of Oz: A Dramatic Composition</a></h3>\\n        <span class=\\\"year\\\">1902 &middot; PDF download</span>\\n        <span class=\\\"read\\\">Open the PDF</span>\\n        <a class=\\\"stretch\\\" href=\\\"https://themarvelouslandofoz.com/OzPlay.pdf\\\" aria-label=\\\"Open the 1902 Oz stage play PDF\\\"></a>\\n      </li>\\n    </ul>\\n    <p class=\\\"cta-note\\\" style=\\\"color:#5d6b64;margin-top:22px\\\">New to Oz? Read them in order &mdash; <a href=\\\"https://themarvelouslandofoz.com/01.htm\\\">begin with Book 1</a>.</p>\\n  </div>\\n</section>\\n\\n<section class=\\\"signup HDLmClassD14118FB\\\">\\n  <div class=\\\"wrap\\\">\\n    <h2>Get a reading plan for the whole series</h2>\\n    <p>Add your email and we'll send you the Oz reading order plus a short note each time we add new illustrations, texts and downloads. One email at a time, unsubscribe whenever you like.</p>\\n    <form id=\\\"signup-form\\\" action=\\\"#\\\" method=\\\"post\\\" novalidate>\\n      <label for=\\\"email\\\" class=\\\"visually-hidden\\\" style=\\\"position:absolute;left:-9999px\\\">Email address</label>\\n      <input id=\\\"email\\\" name=\\\"email\\\" type=\\\"email\\\" placeholder=\\\"you@example.com\\\" autocomplete=\\\"email\\\" required>\\n      <button class=\\\"btn btn-primary\\\" type=\\\"submit\\\">Send me the reading plan</button>\\n    </form>\\n    <p class=\\\"fineprint\\\">No spam, no sharing your address. Just Oz.</p>\\n    <div id=\\\"signup-thanks\\\">Thank you! Your reading plan is on its way &mdash; meanwhile, <a href=\\\"https://themarvelouslandofoz.com/01.htm\\\" style=\\\"color:#e8b647\\\">start Book 1 now</a>.</div>\\n  </div>\\n</section>\\n\\n<section class=\\\"faq\\\" id=\\\"faq\\\">\\n  <div class=\\\"wrap HDLmClassA1A03284\\\">\\n    <h2>Questions readers ask</h2>\\n    <details open>\\n      <summary>Is it really free to read these books here?</summary>\\n      <p>Yes. Every title on this page is in the public domain, so you can read all of it online at no cost, without creating an account.</p>\\n    </details>\\n    <details>\\n      <summary>What order should I read the Oz books in?</summary>\\n      <p>Publication order works best. Start with <a href=\\\"https://themarvelouslandofoz.com/01.htm\\\">The Wonderful Wizard of Oz</a> (1900) and work down the list to <a href=\\\"https://themarvelouslandofoz.com/15.htm\\\">Glinda of Oz</a> (1920).</p>\\n    </details>\\n    <details>\\n      <summary>Can I read on my phone or tablet?</summary>\\n      <p>Yes &mdash; the pages are plain, fast-loading text that reflows to fit any screen size, so they work on phones, tablets, e-readers and desktops.</p>\\n    </details>\\n    <details>\\n      <summary>Are these the complete, unabridged texts?</summary>\\n      <p>They are the complete original novels by L. Frank Baum, plus the 1913 short story collection and the 1902 stage play as a PDF.</p>\\n    </details>\\n  </div>\\n</section>\\n\\n<footer class=\\\"HDLmClass9B211283\\\">\\n  <div class=\\\"wrap\\\">\\n    <p style=\\\"margin:0 0 10px\\\"><a href=\\\"https://themarvelouslandofoz.com/01.htm\\\">Start reading free</a> &middot; <a href=\\\"#books\\\">All 14 books</a> &middot; <a href=\\\"#faq\\\">FAQ</a></p>\\n    <p class=\\\"share\\\" style=\\\"margin:0 0 10px\\\">Share Oz: <a href=\\\"https://www.facebook.com/sharer/sharer.php?u=https%3A%2F%2Fthemarvelouslandofoz.com%2F\\\" rel=\\\"noopener\\\" target=\\\"_blank\\\">Facebook</a><a href=\\\"https://twitter.com/intent/tweet?url=https%3A%2F%2Fthemarvelouslandofoz.com%2F&amp;text=All%2014%20Oz%20books%20free%20to%20read%20online\\\" rel=\\\"noopener\\\" target=\\\"_blank\\\">X</a><a href=\\\"mailto:?subject=All%2014%20Oz%20books%20free%20online&amp;body=https%3A%2F%2Fthemarvelouslandofoz.com%2F\\\">Email</a></p>\\n    <p style=\\\"margin:0\\\">The Marvelous Land of Oz &mdash; the Oz books of L. Frank Baum, free to read online. Texts are in the public domain.</p>\\n  </div>\\n</footer>\\n\\n<script>\\n(function(){\\n  try{\\n    var last=localStorage.getItem('ozLastBook');\\n    if(last){\\n      var d=JSON.parse(last);\\n      if(d&&d.url&&d.title){\\n        document.getElementById('continue-title').textContent=d.title;\\n        document.getElementById('continue-link').setAttribute('href',d.url);\\n        document.getElementById('continue-bar').style.display='block';\\n      }\\n    }\\n  }catch(e){}\\n  var cards=document.querySelectorAll('#books .card');\\n  for(var i=0;i<cards.length;i++){\\n    (function(card){\\n      card.addEventListener('click',function(){\\n        var a=card.querySelector('h3 a');\\n        if(!a)return;\\n        try{localStorage.setItem('ozLastBook',JSON.stringify({url:a.getAttribute('href'),title:a.textContent}));}catch(e){}\\n      });\\n    })(cards[i]);\\n  }\\n  var f=document.getElementById('signup-form');\\n  if(f){\\n    f.addEventListener('submit',function(ev){\\n      var email=document.getElementById('email');\\n      if(!email.value||email.value.indexOf('@')<1){email.focus();return;}\\n      ev.preventDefault();\\n      try{localStorage.setItem('ozSubscriber',email.value);}catch(e){}\\n      f.style.display='none';\\n      document.getElementById('signup-thanks').style.display='block';\\n    });\\n  }\\n})();\\n</script>\\n</body>\\n</html>\",\"improvements\":[{\"What\":\"Added hero CTA\",\"Why\":\"Guides users to read now\",\"Hash\":\"HDLmClass9B211283\"},{\"What\":\"Added book cards\",\"Why\":\"Easier to scan and click\",\"Hash\":\"HDLmClassB6D2BD69\"},{\"What\":\"Added email signup\",\"Why\":\"Builds repeat visits\",\"Hash\":\"HDLmClassD14118FB\"},{\"What\":\"Added mobile styles\",\"Why\":\"Mobile users read more\",\"Hash\":\"HDLmClass132587EC\"},{\"What\":\"Added free badge\",\"Why\":\"Removes cost doubt\",\"Hash\":\"HDLmClassA1A03284\"},{\"What\":\"Fixed Wixard typo\",\"Why\":\"Typos hurt trust\",\"Hash\":\"HDLmClass6564B1F4\"}]}","refusal":null,"reasoning":"I'll go ahead and retrieve that URL.I'm redesigning the simple link list into a fuller page with a hero section, CTA, book cards, trust signals, and email capture. I also need to compute DJB2 hashes for each improvement description, which means carefully working through the hash algorithm by hand for each string since accuracy matters here.\n\nI'm keeping the What/Why text for each improvement concise so the hash computation stays manageable, drafting a few candidate improvements like adding a hero section with a clear headline and \"Start Reading\" CTA to help visitors immediately understand the offer and take action.\n\nTo keep the manual computation manageable, I'll settle on four short improvement entries with concise what/why pairs — hero CTA, book cards, email signup, and mobile styles — each paired with a brief rationale about guiding users and boosting conversions.\n\nStill computing hash values...\n\nContinuing the hash computation step by step for each character, applying modular multiplication and reduction mod 2^32 after each addition.\n\nStill computing the modular hash iterations...\n\nStill working through the mo