art with Book 1 &rarr;</a>\\n      <a class=\\\"btn btn-secondary\\\" href=\\\"#library\\\">Browse all 14 books</a>\\n    </div>\\n    <p class=\\\"hint HDLmClass3A8E4BC0\\\">New to Oz? Begin with <em>The Wonderful Wizard of Oz</em> (1900) &mdash; about a 3&nbsp;hour read.</p>\\n  </header>\\n\\n  <section id=\\\"library\\\" class=\\\"HDLmClassD2118743\\\">\\n    <h2>The Oz Library</h2>\\n    <p class=\\\"lead\\\">Tap any title to start reading instantly. Books are listed in publication order.</p>\\n    <ul class=\\\"grid\\\">\\n      <li class=\\\"card start HDLmClassA68A4C95\\\"><a href=\\\"https://themarvelouslandofoz.com/01.htm\\\"><span class=\\\"num\\\">Book 1 &middot; Start here</span><span class=\\\"t\\\">The Wonderful Wizard of Oz</span><span class=\\\"y\\\">1900</span><span class=\\\"go\\\">Read free &rarr;</span></a></li>\\n      <li class=\\\"card\\\"><a href=\\\"https://themarvelouslandofoz.com/OzPlay.pdf\\\"><span class=\\\"num extra\\\">Bonus &middot; PDF</span><span class=\\\"t\\\">The Wizard of Oz: A Dramatic Composition</span><span class=\\\"y\\\">1902 stage play</span><span class=\\\"go\\\">Open PDF &rarr;</span></a></li>\\n      <li class=\\\"card\\\"><a href=\\\"https://themarvelouslandofoz.com/02.htm\\\"><span class=\\\"num\\\">Book 2</span><span class=\\\"t\\\">The Marvelous Land of Oz</span><span class=\\\"y\\\">1904</span><span class=\\\"go\\\">Read free &rarr;</span></a></li>\\n      <li class=\\\"card\\\"><a href=\\\"https://themarvelouslandofoz.com/03.htm\\\"><span class=\\\"num\\\">Book 3</span><span class=\\\"t\\\">Ozma of Oz</span><span class=\\\"y\\\">1907</span><span class=\\\"go\\\">Read free &rarr;</span></a></li>\\n      <li class=\\\"card\\\"><a href=\\\"https://themarvelouslandofoz.com/04.htm\\\"><span class=\\\"num\\\">Book 4</span><span class=\\\"t\\\">Dorothy and the Wizard in Oz</span><span class=\\\"y\\\">1908</span><span class=\\\"go\\\">Read free &rarr;</span></a></li>\\n      <li class=\\\"card\\\"><a href=\\\"https://themarvelouslandofoz.com/05.htm\\\"><span class=\\\"num\\\">Book 5</span><span class=\\\"t\\\">The Road to Oz</span><span class=\\\"y\\\">1909</span><span class=\\\"go\\\">Read free &rarr;</span></a></li>\\n      <li class=\\\"card\\\"><a href=\\\"https://themarvelouslandofoz.com/06.htm\\\"><span class=\\\"num\\\">Book 6</span><span class=\\\"t\\\">The Emerald City of Oz</span><span class=\\\"y\\\">1910</span><span class=\\\"go\\\">Read free &rarr;</span></a></li>\\n      <li class=\\\"card\\\"><a href=\\\"https://themarvelouslandofoz.com/07.htm\\\"><span class=\\\"num\\\">Book 7</span><span class=\\\"t\\\">The Patchwork Girl of Oz</span><span class=\\\"y\\\">1913</span><span class=\\\"go\\\">Read free &rarr;</span></a></li>\\n      <li class=\\\"card\\\"><a href=\\\"https://themarvelouslandofoz.com/08.htm\\\"><span class=\\\"num extra\\\">Bonus</span><span class=\\\"t\\\">Little Wizard Stories of Oz</span><span class=\\\"y\\\">1913 &middot; 6 short tales</span><span class=\\\"go\\\">Read free &rarr;</span></a></li>\\n      <li class=\\\"card\\\"><a href=\\\"https://themarvelouslandofoz.com/09.htm\\\"><span class=\\\"num\\\">Book 8</span><span class=\\\"t\\\">Tik-Tok of Oz</span><span class=\\\"y\\\">1914</span><span class=\\\"go\\\">Read free &rarr;</span></a></li>\\n      <li class=\\\"card\\\"><a href=\\\"https://themarvelouslandofoz.com/10.htm\\\"><span class=\\\"num\\\">Book 9</span><span class=\\\"t\\\">The Scarecrow of Oz</span><span class=\\\"y\\\">1915</span><span class=\\\"go\\\">Read free &rarr;</span></a></li>\\n      <li class=\\\"card\\\"><a href=\\\"https://themarvelouslandofoz.com/11.htm\\\"><span class=\\\"num\\\">Book 10</span><span class=\\\"t\\\">Rinkitink in Oz</span><span class=\\\"y\\\">1916</span><span class=\\\"go\\\">Read free &rarr;</span></a></li>\\n      <li class=\\\"card\\\"><a href=\\\"https://themarvelouslandofoz.com/12.htm\\\"><span class=\\\"num\\\">Book 11</span><span class=\\\"t\\\">The Lost Princess of Oz</span><span class=\\\"y\\\">1917</span><span class=\\\"go\\\">Read free &rarr;</span></a></li>\\n      <li class=\\\"card\\\"><a href=\\\"https://themarvelouslandofoz.com/13.htm\\\"><span class=\\\"num\\\">Book 12</span><span class=\\\"t\\\">The Tin Woodman of Oz</span><span class=\\\"y\\\">1918</span><span class=\\\"go\\\">Read free &rarr;</span></a></li>\\n      <li class=\\\"card\\\"><a href=\\\"https://themarvelouslandofoz.com/14.htm\\\"><span class=\\\"num\\\">Book 13</span><span class=\\\"t\\\">The Magic of Oz</span><span class=\\\"y\\\">1919</span><span class=\\\"go\\\">Read free &rarr;</span></a></li>\\n      <li class=\\\"card\\\"><a href=\\\"https://themarvelouslandofoz.com/15.htm\\\"><span class=\\\"num\\\">Book 14</span><span class=\\\"t\\\">Glinda of Oz</span><span class=\\\"y\\\">1920</span><span class=\\\"go\\\">Read free &rarr;</span></a></li>\\n    </ul>\\n  </section>\\n\\n  <section class=\\\"HDLmClassA1AF7E65\\\">\\n    <div class=\\\"signup\\\">\\n      <h2>Get a reading guide for all 14 Oz books</h2>\\n      <p>Join the free newsletter and we&rsquo;ll send you the recommended reading order, character guide, and a note whenever new Oz material is added to the site.</p>\\n      <form action=\\\"#\\\" method=\\\"post\\\" novalidate>\\n        <label for=\\\"email\\\" style=\\\"position:absolute;left:-9999px\\\">Email address</label>\\n        <input id=\\\"email\\\" type=\\\"email\\\" name=\\\"email\\\" placeholder=\\\"you@example.com\\\" required>\\n        <button type=\\\"submit\\\">Send me the guide</button>\\n      </form>\\n      <small>One email at a time. Unsubscribe with one click. We never share your address.</small>\\n    </div>\\n  </section>\\n\\n  <section class=\\\"HDLmClass7E21C39E\\\">\\n    <div class=\\\"shop\\\">\\n      <h2>Prefer a printed or audio edition?</h2>\\n      <p class=\\\"lead\\\">Reading online is free forever. If you&rsquo;d like a copy for the shelf, the bedside table, or the car, these editions are widely available.</p>\\n      <ul>\\n        <li><a href=\\\"https://www.amazon.com/s?k=L.+Frank+Baum+Wizard+of+Oz+complete+collection\\\" rel=\\\"nofollow noopener\\\" target=\\\"_blank\\\">Illustrated hardcover &amp; paperback collections</a></li>\\n        <li><a href=\\\"https://www.amazon.com/s?k=Wizard+of+Oz+audiobook+L.+Frank+Baum\\\" rel=\\\"nofollow noopener\\\" target=\\\"_blank\\\">Audiobook editions for the whole series</a></li>\\n        <li><a href=\\\"https://www.amazon.com/s?k=Wizard+of+Oz+Kindle+L.+Frank+Baum\\\" rel=\\\"nofollow noopener\\\" target=\\\"_blank\\\">Kindle &amp; e-reader editions</a></li>\\n      </ul>\\n      <p class=\\\"hint\\\" style=\\\"text-align:left;margin-top:14px\\\">Purchases made through these links may earn this site a small commission, which keeps the books here free to read.</p>\\n    </div>\\n  </section>\\n\\n  <section class=\\\"HDLmClass84CB980E\\\">\\n    <h2>About this collection</h2>\\n    <p class=\\\"lead\\\">L.&nbsp;Frank Baum wrote fourteen Oz novels between 1900 and 1920, creating one of the most beloved fantasy worlds in American literature. All of these works are in the public domain, so you are free to read, print, and share them. Start at Book&nbsp;1 for the classic journey down the yellow brick road, or jump to any title that catches your eye.</p>\\n    <div class=\\\"cta-row\\\">\\n      <a class=\\\"btn btn-primary\\\" href=\\\"https://themarvelouslandofoz.com/01.htm\\\">Start reading Book 1 free &rarr;</a>\\n    </div>\\n  </section>\\n\\n  <footer>\\n    <p>The Marvelous Land of Oz &middot; The complete Oz books of L.&nbsp;Frank Baum, free to read online.</p>\\n  </footer>\\n\\n</div>\\n</body>\\n</html>\",\"improvements\":[{\"What\":\"Hero intro added\",\"Why\":\"Clarifies value fast\",\"Hash\":\"HDLmClass84CB980E\"},{\"What\":\"Card list layout\",\"Why\":\"Easier scanning\",\"Hash\":\"HDLmClassD2118743\"},{\"What\":\"Email signup added\",\"Why\":\"Captures leads\",\"Hash\":\"HDLmClassA1AF7E65\"},{\"What\":\"Fixed Wixard typo\",\"Why\